<title>USA: Wash. Mutual application deemed complete.</title>
<headline>Wash. Mutual application deemed complete.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Mutual Inc said the U.S. Office of Thrift Supervision deemed its application for its proposed merger with Great Western Financial Corp complete.</p>
<p>As previously announced, special meetings have been scheduled for June 13, 1997 for stockholders of both companies to approve the merger agreement.</p>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson and Co, which has launched a hostile bid for Great Western, said Tuesday its application was deemed complete by the OTS.</p>
</text>
